// Two rules are broken here, and the metadata one comes first in source order and
// has to be reported first. The nesting guard runs AFTER the member's annotations
// are parsed for exactly this reason: skipping them in lookahead would find the
// nested declaration sooner and announce the nesting rule over an unregistered
// @co.* name the author has to fix either way.
_ co.class = {

    @co.dap.nosuchthing
    Inner co.struct = {
        city co.string;
    }
}
